topic: ~select_d()
language: enu

concept:(outbreak) [outbreak "outbreak origins" zombie zombies]
concept:(farcry) [farcry "far cry" "far cry V R"]
concept:(spacemarines) ["space marine" "space marines" warhammer]



# Steps 4 and 5: choose and confirm, by voice or tablet
u:(~outbreak) Great choice! You selected Outbreak. $onStopped=1
u:(~farcry) Great choice! You selected Far Cry. $onStopped=2
u:(~spacemarines) Great choice! You selected Space Marines. $onStopped=3
u:(e:outbreakSelected) Great choice! You selected Outbreak. $onStopped=1
u:(e:farcrySelected) Great choice! You selected Far Cry. $onStopped=2
u:(e:spacemarinesSelected) Great choice! You selected Space Marines. $onStopped=3

# Extension 3a: more information about one game
u:(["tell me more about" "what is" describe] ~outbreak) Outbreak Origins is a zombie survival game for up to 8 players. A deadly virus has hit the population, and your team fights hordes of zombies and attacks helicopters. Which game do you want?
u:(["tell me more about" "what is" describe] ~farcry) Far Cry V R, Dive Into Insanity, takes place on Rook Island. Vaas and his gang capture you, and your team must survive together. Which game do you want?
u:(["tell me more about" "what is" describe] ~spacemarines) In Warhammer forty thousand Space Marine V R, you play a powerful Space Marine and fight the Tyranids to defend Avarax. Which game do you want?

# Extension 4a: undecided, so offer filters
u:(["I do not know" "I am not sure" undecided]) I can filter the games for you. By style, by intensity, or by number of players?
    u1:(style) Do you prefer zombies, jungle survival, or sci fi combat?
        u2:(zombies) Then Outbreak fits you. Say outbreak, or tap it.
        u2:(jungle) Then Far Cry fits you. Say far cry, or tap it.
        u2:("sci fi") Then Space Marines fits you. Say space marines, or tap it.
    u1:(intensity) Do you want something scary, an adventure, or all out action?
        u2:(scary) Then Outbreak fits you. Say outbreak, or tap it.
        u2:(adventure) Then Far Cry fits you. Say far cry, or tap it.
        u2:(action) Then Space Marines fits you. Say space marines, or tap it.
    u1:(players) All three games take up to 8 players, so any of them works for your group. Which one do you want?